,\" you know, \"Shoo Fly Pie,\" or \"Five Minutes More,\" I remember those. \"Home on the Range\" was there, too. Things like that. I dont remember til later on when I was hired and then moved to Fukuoka, and I was hired by a big band. This was the first big band excitedly), and it was Ryutaro Yamada and his band, his orchestra.", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q18069$81417543-8613-4DB0-AEF6-BD9F9A77FA1A", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "38e23ca24e7811df7722c524bc822546d1aa98d9", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/543c36b950bfb0983d635da75e059b40/116.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q18069$98A983DD-F163-4322-B352-E2F32D11A4B4", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "4a99a778574935178a25f2016701c8255284353c", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 2003, "id": "Q2003"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q18069$CD5ABD3A-257B-4817-9D87-C4870DF8D1E5", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "0c21fd01447f9981d6febefb33347c3f45c29f90", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 892, "id": "Q892"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q18069$AF6B2637-7DC7-402B-8856-9EFFE6854796", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "0bc520a8d862f0943264e44b5a48079bd8778019", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 892, "id": "Q892"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q18069$408EFD88-5AE5-4C87-B34C-1925F86A379E", "rank": "normal"}]}}